    thinking: "**Building Context Panel**\n\nI\'m currently focused on constructing the `ContextPanel` component, specifically addressing the dynamic behavior. I\'m prioritizing the implementation of manual selector toggles for various contexts, such as \"Dom,\" \"Szko\305\202a,\" and \"Park,\" which will trigger adaptations to the secondary area of the panel. I\'m aiming for a 30% area allocation for this right/bottom panel.\n\n\n**Expanding Contextual Inputs**\n\nNow, I\'m integrating several key functional capabilities within the `ContextPanel`. I\'m focusing on dynamic inputs for time (morning/evening vocab), sequential prediction based on verb selection (loading nouns/objects), and geolocation API integration. The goal is to provide multiple context options like \"Jedzenie\" and \"Emocje.\" The geolocation button will be key, and the overall UI will involve tabs and badges for selector components.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
