    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Professional Polish\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"pl\\\">\\n<head>\\n<style>\\n  :root {\\n    --bg-main: #f1f5f9;\\n    --slate-800: #1e293b;\\n    --slate-700: #334155;\\n    --slate-200: #e2e8f0;\\n    --pronoun-yellow: #fef08a;\\n    --verb-green: #bbf7d0;\\n    --adj-blue: #bae6fd;\\n    --noun-orange: #fed7aa;\\n    --social-white: #ffffff;\\n    --action-red: #fecaca;\\n  }\\n  body, html {\\n    margin: 0;\\n    padding: 0;\\n    height: 100vh;\\n    width: 100vw;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n    font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, sans-serif;\\n    background-color: var(--bg-main);\\n  }\\n  .app-container {\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-direction: column;\\n    height: 100vh;\\n    padding: 12px;\\n    box-sizing: border-box;\\n    gap: 12px;\\n  }\\n  /* Top Sentence Bar */\\n  .sentence-bar {\\n    height: 140px;\\n    background: white;\\n    border: 3px solid var(--slate-800);\\n    border-radius: 12px;\\n    display: flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    padding: 0 16px;\\n    gap: 12px;\\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);\\n  }\\n  .sentence-items {\\n    flex-grow: 1;\\n    display: flex;\\n    gap: 8px;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n  }\\n  .sentence-tile {\\n    width: 90px;\\n    height: 110px;\\n    border: 2px solid var(--slate-700);\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-direction: column;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    justify-content: center;\\n    background: var(--social-white);\\n    font-size: 12px;\\n    font-weight: bold;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n  }\\n  .tile-img-placeholder {\\n    width: 60px;\\n    height: 60px;\\n    background: #eee;\\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\\n    border-radius: 4px;\\n    display: flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    justify-content: center;\\n    font-size: 24px;\\n  }\\n  .sentence-controls {\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-direction: column;\\n    gap: 8px;\\n  }\\n  .btn {\\n    padding: 10px 20px;\\n    border: 2px solid var(--slate-800);\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    font-weight: 800;\\n    cursor: pointer;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n    display: flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    justify-content: center;\\n    gap: 6px;\\n  }\\n  .btn-clear { background: var(--action-red); }\\n  .btn-action { background: var(--adj-blue); }\\n\\n  /* Main Grid Area */\\n  .main-content {\\n    flex-grow: 1;\\n    display: flex;\\n    gap: 12px;\\n    min-height: 0;\\n  }\\n  .core-grid {\\n    flex: 0 0 70%;\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\\n    grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 1fr);\\n    gap: 10px;\\n  }\\n  .context-panel {\\n    flex: 0 0 30%;\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-direction: column;\\n    gap: 10px;\\n    border-left: 2px dashed var(--slate-200);\\n    padding-left: 12px;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* AAC Tiles */\\n  .aac-tile {\\n    border: 3px solid var(--slate-800);\\n    border-radius: 12px;\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-direction: column;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    justify-content: space-between;\\n    padding: 12px;\\n    cursor: pointer;\\n    transition: opacity 0.1s;\\n  }\\n  .aac-tile:active { opacity: 0.7; }\\n  .aac-tile .label {\\n    font-size: 18px;\\n    font-weight: 900;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n    text-align: center;\\n  }\\n  .aac-tile img {\\n    width: 100px;\\n    height: 100px;\\n    object-fit: contain;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* Categories and Context Controls */\\n  .context-header {\\n    font-weight: 800;\\n    color: var(--slate-700);\\n    font-size: 12px;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\\n  }\\n  .category-strip {\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\\n    gap: 8px;\\n  }\\n  .cat-btn {\\n    padding: 12px;\\n    background: white;\\n    border: 2px solid var(--slate-700);\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n    font-size: 13px;\\n    text-align: center;\\n  }\\n  .cat-btn.active {\\n    background: var(--slate-800);\\n    color: white;\\n  }\\n  .dynamic-results {\\n    flex-grow: 1;\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\\n    grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 1fr);\\n    gap: 8px;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* Specific Color Map */\\n  .pronoun { background-color: var(--pronoun-yellow); }\\n  .verb { background-color: var(--verb-green); }\\n  .noun { background-color: var(--noun-orange); }\\n  .social { background-color: var(--social-white); }\\n  .adj { background-color: var(--adj-blue); }\\n\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"app-container\\\">\\n    <!-- Sentence Bar Section -->\\n    <div class=\\\"sentence-bar\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"sentence-items\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"sentence-tile pronoun\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\221\244</div>\\n          <span>JA</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"sentence-tile verb\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\342\234\213</div>\\n          <span>CHC\304\230</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"sentence-tile noun\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\215\216</div>\\n          <span>JAB\305\201KO</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"sentence-controls\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"btn btn-clear\\\">WYCZY\305\232\304\206</button>\\n        <button class=\\\"btn btn-action\\\">POWI\304\230KSZ</button>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Communication Grids -->\\n    <div class=\\\"main-content\\\">\\n      <!-- Left: Core Grid (70%) -->\\n      <div class=\\\"core-grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile pronoun\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">JA</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\221\244</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile verb\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">CHC\304\230</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\342\234\213</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile social\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">NIE</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\342\234\226\357\270\217</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile verb\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">LUBI\304\230</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\342\235\244\357\270\217</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile adj\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">TO</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\221\211</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile adj\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">GDZIE</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\342\235\223</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile social\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">STOP</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\233\221</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile social\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">WI\304\230CEJ</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\342\236\225</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Right: Dynamic Context (30%) -->\\n      <div class=\\\"context-panel\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <div class=\\\"context-header\\\">Kontekst: MIEJSCE</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"category-strip\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"cat-btn active\\\">DOM</button>\\n            <button class=\\\"cat-btn\\\">SZKO\305\201A</button>\\n            <button class=\\\"cat-btn\\\">PARK</button>\\n            <button class=\\\"cat-btn\\\">JEDZENIE</button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"flex-grow:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px;\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"context-header\\\">Podpowiedzi dynamiczne</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"dynamic-results\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"aac-tile noun\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"label\\\">PI\304\206</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\245\233</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"aac-tile noun\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"label\\\">JE\305\232\304\206</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\215\264</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"aac-tile noun\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"label\\\">SPA\304\206</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\233\214</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"aac-tile noun\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"label\\\">GRA\304\206</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\216\262</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        \\n        <button class=\\\"btn\\\" style=\\\"background:#e2e8f0; font-size: 11px;\\\">\\n          \360\237\223\215 U\305\273YJ LOKALIZACJI\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Professional Polish\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"pl\\\">\\n<head>\\n<style>\\n  :root {\\n    --bg-main: #f1f5f9;\\n    --slate-800: #1e293b;\\n    --slate-700: #334155;\\n    --slate-200: #e2e8f0;\\n    --pronoun-yellow: #fef08a;\\n    --verb-green: #bbf7d0;\\n    --adj-blue: #bae6fd;\\n    --noun-orange: #fed7aa;\\n    --social-white: #ffffff;\\n    --action-red: #fecaca;\\n  }\\n  body, html {\\n    margin: 0;\\n    padding: 0;\\n    height: 100vh;\\n    width: 100vw;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n    font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, sans-serif;\\n    background-color: var(--bg-main);\\n  }\\n  .app-container {\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-direction: column;\\n    height: 100vh;\\n    padding: 12px;\\n    box-sizing: border-box;\\n    gap: 12px;\\n  }\\n  /* Top Sentence Bar */\\n  .sentence-bar {\\n    height: 140px;\\n    background: white;\\n    border: 3px solid var(--slate-800);\\n    border-radius: 12px;\\n    display: flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    padding: 0 16px;\\n    gap: 12px;\\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);\\n  }\\n  .sentence-items {\\n    flex-grow: 1;\\n    display: flex;\\n    gap: 8px;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n  }\\n  .sentence-tile {\\n    width: 90px;\\n    height: 110px;\\n    border: 2px solid var(--slate-700);\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-direction: column;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    justify-content: center;\\n    background: var(--social-white);\\n    font-size: 12px;\\n    font-weight: bold;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n  }\\n  .tile-img-placeholder {\\n    width: 60px;\\n    height: 60px;\\n    background: #eee;\\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\\n    border-radius: 4px;\\n    display: flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    justify-content: center;\\n    font-size: 24px;\\n  }\\n  .sentence-controls {\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-direction: column;\\n    gap: 8px;\\n  }\\n  .btn {\\n    padding: 10px 20px;\\n    border: 2px solid var(--slate-800);\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    font-weight: 800;\\n    cursor: pointer;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n    display: flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    justify-content: center;\\n    gap: 6px;\\n  }\\n  .btn-clear { background: var(--action-red); }\\n  .btn-action { background: var(--adj-blue); }\\n\\n  /* Main Grid Area */\\n  .main-content {\\n    flex-grow: 1;\\n    display: flex;\\n    gap: 12px;\\n    min-height: 0;\\n  }\\n  .core-grid {\\n    flex: 0 0 70%;\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\\n    grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 1fr);\\n    gap: 10px;\\n  }\\n  .context-panel {\\n    flex: 0 0 30%;\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-direction: column;\\n    gap: 10px;\\n    border-left: 2px dashed var(--slate-200);\\n    padding-left: 12px;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* AAC Tiles */\\n  .aac-tile {\\n    border: 3px solid var(--slate-800);\\n    border-radius: 12px;\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-direction: column;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    justify-content: space-between;\\n    padding: 12px;\\n    cursor: pointer;\\n    transition: opacity 0.1s;\\n  }\\n  .aac-tile:active { opacity: 0.7; }\\n  .aac-tile .label {\\n    font-size: 18px;\\n    font-weight: 900;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n    text-align: center;\\n  }\\n  .aac-tile img {\\n    width: 100px;\\n    height: 100px;\\n    object-fit: contain;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* Categories and Context Controls */\\n  .context-header {\\n    font-weight: 800;\\n    color: var(--slate-700);\\n    font-size: 12px;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\\n  }\\n  .category-strip {\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\\n    gap: 8px;\\n  }\\n  .cat-btn {\\n    padding: 12px;\\n    background: white;\\n    border: 2px solid var(--slate-700);\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n    font-size: 13px;\\n    text-align: center;\\n  }\\n  .cat-btn.active {\\n    background: var(--slate-800);\\n    color: white;\\n  }\\n  .dynamic-results {\\n    flex-grow: 1;\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\\n    grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 1fr);\\n    gap: 8px;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* Specific Color Map */\\n  .pronoun { background-color: var(--pronoun-yellow); }\\n  .verb { background-color: var(--verb-green); }\\n  .noun { background-color: var(--noun-orange); }\\n  .social { background-color: var(--social-white); }\\n  .adj { background-color: var(--adj-blue); }\\n\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"app-container\\\">\\n    <!-- Sentence Bar Section -->\\n    <div class=\\\"sentence-bar\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"sentence-items\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"sentence-tile pronoun\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\221\244</div>\\n          <span>JA</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"sentence-tile verb\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\342\234\213</div>\\n          <span>CHC\304\230</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"sentence-tile noun\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\215\216</div>\\n          <span>JAB\305\201KO</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"sentence-controls\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"btn btn-clear\\\">WYCZY\305\232\304\206</button>\\n        <button class=\\\"btn btn-action\\\">POWI\304\230KSZ</button>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Communication Grids -->\\n    <div class=\\\"main-content\\\">\\n      <!-- Left: Core Grid (70%) -->\\n      <div class=\\\"core-grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile pronoun\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">JA</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\221\244</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile verb\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">CHC\304\230</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\342\234\213</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile social\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">NIE</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\342\234\226\357\270\217</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile verb\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">LUBI\304\230</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\342\235\244\357\270\217</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile adj\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">TO</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\221\211</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile adj\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">GDZIE</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\342\235\223</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile social\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">STOP</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\233\221</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"aac-tile social\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"label\\\">WI\304\230CEJ</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\342\236\225</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Right: Dynamic Context (30%) -->\\n      <div class=\\\"context-panel\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <div class=\\\"context-header\\\">Kontekst: MIEJSCE</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"category-strip\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"cat-btn active\\\">DOM</button>\\n            <button class=\\\"cat-btn\\\">SZKO\305\201A</button>\\n            <button class=\\\"cat-btn\\\">PARK</button>\\n            <button class=\\\"cat-btn\\\">JEDZENIE</button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"flex-grow:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px;\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"context-header\\\">Podpowiedzi dynamiczne</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"dynamic-results\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"aac-tile noun\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"label\\\">PI\304\206</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\245\233</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"aac-tile noun\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"label\\\">JE\305\232\304\206</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\215\264</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"aac-tile noun\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"label\\\">SPA\304\206</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\233\214</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"aac-tile noun\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"label\\\">GRA\304\206</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"tile-img-placeholder\\\">\360\237\216\262</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        \\n        <button class=\\\"btn\\\" style=\\\"background:#e2e8f0; font-size: 11px;\\\">\\n          \360\237\223\215 U\305\273YJ LOKALIZACJI\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
