ram.word}`}\n45:       className={`\n46:         relative group flex flex-col items-center justify-between rounded-xl transition-all duration-150 cursor-pointer select-none\n47:         focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-amber-500 focus:ring-offset-2\n48:         shadow-sm hover:shadow-md active:scale-95 touch-manipulation\n49:         ${sizeClasses[size]}\n50:         ${\n51:           highContrast\n52:             ? config.highContrastBg\n53:             : `${config.bgClass} border-3 ${config.borderClass}`\n54:         }\n55:       `}\n56:     >\n57:       {/* Category Badge if enabled */}\n58:       {showCategoryBadge && !highContrast && (\n59:         <span\n60:           className={`absolute top-1 left-1 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold rounded-md ${config.badgeBgClass}`}\n61:         >\n62:           {config.name.split(\'/\')[0]}\n63:         </span>\n64:       )}\n65: \n66:       {/* Pictogram Image Container */}\n67:       <div className=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center w-full my-0.5 relative overflow-hidden\">\n68:         {!isLoaded && !imageError && (\n69:           <div className=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-200/50 rounded-lg animate-pulse\">\n70:             <span className=\"sr-only\">\305\201adowanie...</span>\n71:           </div>\n72:         )}\n73: \n74:         {!imageError ? (\n75:           <img\n76:             src={imageUrl}\n77:             alt={pictogram.word}\n78:             loading=\"lazy\"\n79:             crossOrigin=\"anonymous\"\n80:             onLoad={() => setIsLoaded(true)}\n81:             onError={() => setImageError(true)}\n82:             className={`\n83:               object-contain transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:scale-105\n84:               ${imageSizes[size]}\n85:               ${!isLoaded ? \'opacity-0\' : \'opacity-100\'}\n86:             `}\n87:           />\n88:         ) : (\n89:           <div className=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center tex