    modified_response: "I have fixed the pictogram image loading issue and ensured all images load properly across the application:\n\n- **Resolved Image CORS Constraints**: Removed the `crossOrigin=\"anonymous\"` tag attribute that was causing browser CORS checks to block images from `static.arasac.org`. Added `referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\"` to allow direct cross-origin asset loading.\n- **Progressive Image Fallback Strategy**: Implemented fallback image loaders (`500px` \342\206\222 `300px` \342\206\222 ARASAC API stream) to guarantee pictogram image retrieval.\n- **Graceful AAC Fallback Badges**: Added a high-contrast symbol badge fallback (matching Fitzgerald Key color codes with initial letters) if an image ever fails to load, keeping cards clear and clickable.\n- **Professional Polish Styling**: Maintained crisp high-contrast layout borders, uppercase category headers, and official Fitzgerald Key color coding."
