  user_input {
    user_response: "Role: You are a Senior AAC Software Architect.\n\nGoal: Completely ELIMINATE live text-searching from the main board rendering loop. Build a robust, scalable AAC Web App using a structured, local JSON Map for all Vocabulary (Core + Contexts) with visual Fallbacks.\n\nTHE CORE ARCHITECTURAL RULE:\nNever call `api.arasac.org/v1/pictograms/pl/search/` during main UI rendering. All board buttons must render directly using a local JSON map containing explicit ARASAC SVG IDs (`https://static.arasac.org/pictograms/{id}/{id}.svg`).\n\n1. STRUCTURE THE LOCAL VOCABULARY DATABASE (JSON):\nCreate an extensible JavaScript data object `VOCABULARY_DB`:\n\n```javascript\nconst VOCABULARY_DB = {\n  core: [\n    { label: \"Ja\", id: 5529, category: \"Osoby\", color: \"yellow\" },\n    { label: \"Chc\304\231\", id: 2445, category: \"Czasowniki\", color: \"green\" },\n    { label: \"Nie\", id: 5537, category: \"Przeczenie\", color: \"red\" },\n    { label: \"Lubi\304\231\", id: 3262, category: \"Czasowniki\", color: \"green\" },\n    { label: \"Stop\", id: 6242, category: \"Spo\305\202eczne\", color: \"red\" },\n    { label: \"Wi\304\231cej\", id: 7088, category: \"Inne\", color: \"blue\" }\n  ],\n  contexts: {\n    dom: [\n      { label: \"Je\305\233\304\207\", id: 2341, category: \"Czasowniki\", color: \"green\" },\n      { label: \"Pi\304\207\", id: 2380, category: \"Czasowniki\", color: \"green\" },\n      { label: \"Toaleta\", id: 3060, category: \"Miejsca\", color: \"yellow\" },\n      { label: \"Mama\", id: 2465, category: \"Osoby\", color: \"yellow\" }\n    ],\n    szkola: [\n      { label: \"Pisa\304\207\", id: 2506, category: \"Czasowniki\", color: \"green\" },\n      { label: \"Czyta\304\207\", id: 2419, category: \"Czasowniki\", color: \"green\" },\n      { label: \"Przerwa\", id: 8168, category: \"Inne\", color: \"blue\" }\n    ]\n  }\n};"
    items {
      text: "Role: You are a Senior AAC Software Architect.\n\nGoal: Completely ELIMINATE live text-searching from the main board rendering loop. Build a robust, scalable AAC Web App using a structured, local JSON Map for all Vocabulary (Core + Contexts) with visual Fallbacks.\n\nTHE CORE ARCHITECTURAL RULE:\nNever call `api.arasac.org/v1/pictograms/pl/search/` during main UI rendering. All board buttons must render directly using a local JSON map containing explicit ARASAC SVG IDs (`https://static.arasac.org/pictograms/{id}/{id}.svg`).\n\n1. STRUCTURE THE LOCAL VOCABULARY DATABASE (JSON):\nCreate an extensible JavaScript data object `VOCABULARY_DB`:\n\n```javascript\nconst VOCABULARY_DB = {\n  core: [\n    { label: \"Ja\", id: 5529, category: \"Osoby\", color: \"yellow\" },\n    { label: \"Chc\304\231\", id: 2445, category: \"Czasowniki\", color: \"green\" },\n    { label: \"Nie\", id: 5537, category: \"Przeczenie\", color: \"red\" },\n    { label: \"Lubi\304\231\", id: 3262, category: \"Czasowniki\", color: \"green\" },\n    { label: \"Stop\", id: 6242, category: \"Spo\305\202eczne\", color: \"red\" },\n    { label: \"Wi\304\231cej\", id: 7088, category: \"Inne\", color: \"blue\" }\n  ],\n  contexts: {\n    dom: [\n      { label: \"Je\305\233\304\207\", id: 2341, category: \"Czasowniki\", color: \"green\" },\n      { label: \"Pi\304\207\", id: 2380, category: \"Czasowniki\", color: \"green\" },\n      { label: \"Toaleta\", id: 3060, category: \"Miejsca\", color: \"yellow\" },\n      { label: \"Mama\", id: 2465, category: \"Osoby\", color: \"yellow\" }\n    ],\n    szkola: [\n      { label: \"Pisa\304\207\", id: 2506, category: \"Czasowniki\", color: \"green\" },\n      { label: \"Czyta\304\207\", id: 2419, category: \"Czasowniki\", color: \"green\" },\n      { label: \"Przerwa\", id: 8168, category: \"Inne\", color: \"blue\" }\n    ]\n  }\n};"
    }
