steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
      seconds: 1784805991
      nanos: 504755581
    }
    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Role: You are a Senior Frontend Engineer specializing in AAC (Augmentative and Alternative Communication) web applications and browser sandbox compatibility.\n\nGoal: Build a fully functional, responsive Single-Page Web Application (SPA) for a Context-Adaptive AAC Communication Board using online-hosted pictograms.\n\nONLINE DATA ARCHITECTURE & RULES:\n\n1. CORE VOCABULARY (Direct ARASAC Online CDN):\n   Do NOT use text-based API searches for Core Vocabulary. Map explicit Polish labels directly to their verified ARASAC CDN URLs: `https://static.arasac.org/pictograms/{id}/{id}_500.png`\n\n   Use this exact JSON array for Core Vocabulary:\n   - \"Ja\": ID 5529 (Category: \"Osoby\", Color: \"yellow\")\n   - \"Chc\304\231\": ID 2445 (Category: \"Czasowniki\", Color: \"green\")\n   - \"Nie\": ID 5537 (Category: \"Przeczenie\", Color: \"red\")\n   - \"Lubi\304\231\": ID 3262 (Category: \"Czasowniki\", Color: \"green\")\n   - \"To\": ID 36329 (Category: \"Inne\", Color: \"blue\")\n   - \"Stop\": ID 6242 (Category: \"Spo\305\202eczne\", Color: \"red\")\n   - \"Wi\304\231cej\": ID 7088 (Category: \"Inne\", Color: \"blue\")\n   - \"Gdzie\": ID 6231 (Category: \"Pytania\", Color: \"purple\")\n   - \"Pomoc\": ID 5519 (Category: \"Spo\305\202eczne\", Color: \"red\")\n\n2. STATIC CONTEXT PANELS (Pre-defined Online Maps):\n   Render context panels (\"Dom\", \"Szko\305\202a\", \"Park\") using a fixed local JSON dictionary with verified ARASAC IDs:\n   - Dom: \"Je\305\233\304\207\" (2341), \"Pi\304\207\" (2380), \"Spa\304\207\" (2523), \"Toaleta\" (3060), \"Mama\" (2465)\n   - Szko\305\202a: \"Pisa\304\207\" (2506), \"Czyta\304\207\" (2419), \"Ksi\304\205\305\274ka\" (2855), \"Przerwa\" (8168)\n   - Park: \"Biega\304\207\" (2404), \"Hu\305\233tawka\" (3258), \"Pi\305\202ka\" (2795), \"Pies\" (2838)\n\n3. DYNAMIC SEARCH ENGINE (Open Symbols API):\n   Include an \"Asekuracyjne Wyszukiwanie\" input bar in the context area. When the user types a custom word, fetch candidates from Open Symbols API online:\n   `https://www.opensymbols.org/api/v2/symbols?q=${encodeURIComponent(query)}`\n   Display the image from `image_url`. If fetch fails, fallback to a stylized text-card.\n\nAI STUDIO SANDBOX SAFETY RULES:\n- DO NOT use inline `onclick=\"...\"` or `onchange=\"...\"` handlers in HTML. They get blocked by AI Studio\'s Security Policy (CSP).\n- Attach ALL event listeners dynamically via JS inside `document.addEventListener(\'DOMContentLoaded\', ...)` using `addEventListener()`.\n\nUI REQUIREMENTS:\n- Top Sentence Bar: Displays selected cards dynamically. Features \"Usu\305\204\" (Delete last), \"Wyczy\305\233\304\207\" (Clear all), and \"Powi\304\231ksz\" (Fullscreen Presentation Modal).\n- Core Vocabulary Section: Fixed layout to preserve muscle memory.\n- Dynamic Context Section: Switchable panels + custom word search.\n- Card Design: Shows image, Polish text label, and color-coded category border.\n\nOutput:\nProvide the full, production-ready, single-file HTML/Tailwind CSS/JS code ready for immediate execution in Google AI Studio Preview."
    items {
      text: "Role: You are a Senior Frontend Engineer specializing in AAC (Augmentative and Alternative Communication) web applications and browser sandbox compatibility.\n\nGoal: Build a fully functional, responsive Single-Page Web Application (SPA) for a Context-Adaptive AAC Communication Board using online-hosted pictograms.\n\nONLINE DATA ARCHITECTURE & RULES:\n\n1. CORE VOCABULARY (Direct ARASAC Online CDN):\n   Do NOT use text-based API searches for Core Vocabulary. Map explicit Polish labels directly to their verified ARASAC CDN URLs: `https://static.arasac.org/pictograms/{id}/{id}_500.png`\n\n   Use this exact JSON array for Core Vocabulary:\n   - \"Ja\": ID 5529 (Category: \"Osoby\", Color: \"yellow\")\n   - \"Chc\304\231\": ID 2445 (Category: \"Czasowniki\", Color: \"green\")\n   - \"Nie\": ID 5537 (Category: \"Przeczenie\", Color: \"red\")\n   - \"Lubi\304\231\": ID 3262 (Category: \"Czasowniki\", Color: \"green\")\n   - \"To\": ID 36329 (Category: \"Inne\", Color: \"blue\")\n   - \"Stop\": ID 6242 (Category: \"Spo\305\202eczne\", Color: \"red\")\n   - \"Wi\304\231cej\": ID 7088 (Category: \"Inne\", Color: \"blue\")\n   - \"Gdzie\": ID 6231 (Category: \"Pytania\", Color: \"purple\")\n   - \"Pomoc\": ID 5519 (Category: \"Spo\305\202eczne\", Color: \"red\")\n\n2. STATIC CONTEXT PANELS (Pre-defined Online Maps):\n   Render context panels (\"Dom\", \"Szko\305\202a\", \"Park\") using a fixed local JSON dictionary with verified ARASAC IDs:\n   - Dom: \"Je\305\233\304\207\" (2341), \"Pi\304\207\" (2380), \"Spa\304\207\" (2523), \"Toaleta\" (3060), \"Mama\" (2465)\n   - Szko\305\202a: \"Pisa\304\207\" (2506), \"Czyta\304\207\" (2419), \"Ksi\304\205\305\274ka\" (2855), \"Przerwa\" (8168)\n   - Park: \"Biega\304\207\" (2404), \"Hu\305\233tawka\" (3258), \"Pi\305\202ka\" (2795), \"Pies\" (2838)\n\n3. DYNAMIC SEARCH ENGINE (Open Symbols API):\n   Include an \"Asekuracyjne Wyszukiwanie\" input bar in the context area. When the user types a custom word, fetch candidates from Open Symbols API online:\n   `https://www.opensymbols.org/api/v2/symbols?q=${encodeURIComponent(query)}`\n   Display the image from `image_url`. If fetch fails, fallback to a stylized text-card.\n\nAI STUDIO SANDBOX SAFETY RULES:\n- DO NOT use inline `onclick=\"...\"` or `onchange=\"...\"` handlers in HTML. They get blocked by AI Studio\'s Security Policy (CSP).\n- Attach ALL event listeners dynamically via JS inside `document.addEventListener(\'DOMContentLoaded\', ...)` using `addEventListener()`.\n\nUI REQUIREMENTS:\n- Top Sentence Bar: Displays selected cards dynamically. Features \"Usu\305\204\" (Delete last), \"Wyczy\305\233\304\207\" (Clear all), and \"Powi\304\231ksz\" (Fullscreen Presentation Modal).\n- Core Vocabulary Section: Fixed layout to preserve muscle memory.\n- Dynamic Context Section: Switchable panels + custom word search.\n- Card Design: Shows image, Polish text label, and color-coded category border.\n\nOutput:\nProvide the full, production-ready, single-file HTML/Tailwind CSS/JS code ready for immediate execution in Google AI Studio Preview."
    }
  }
}
