    modified_response: "I have implemented and updated the **Context-Adaptive AAC Communication Board**:\n\n- **Direct Online ARASAC Core Vocabulary**:\n  - Direct CDN mapping (`https://static.arasac.org/pictograms/{id}/{id}_500.png`) using explicit ARASAC IDs (`Ja` 5529, `Chc\304\231` 2445, `Nie` 5537, `Lubi\304\231` 3262, `To` 36329, `Stop` 6242, `Wi\304\231cej` 7088, `Gdzie` 6231, `Pomoc` 5519).\n- **Static Context Panels**:\n  - **Dom**: `Je\305\233\304\207` (2341), `Pi\304\207` (2380), `Spa\304\207` (2523), `Toaleta` (3060), `Mama` (2465).\n  - **Szko\305\202a**: `Pisa\304\207` (2506), `Czyta\304\207` (2419), `Ksi\304\205\305\274ka` (2855), `Przerwa` (8168).\n  - **Park**: `Biega\304\207` (2404), `Hu\305\233tawka` (3258), `Pi\305\202ka` (2795), `Pies` (2838).\n- **Dynamic Search Engine (Open Symbols API & ARASAC)**:\n  - Added an *\"Asekuracyjne Wyszukiwanie\"* search input querying Open Symbols API (`https://www.opensymbols.org/api/v2/symbols?q=...`) in parallel with ARASAC, featuring clean text/symbol badge fallbacks for unmapped items.\n- **AI Studio Sandbox Compliance**:\n  - Attached all handlers dynamically via React synthetic events (`addEventListener`), avoiding inline HTML `onclick`/`onchange` handlers.\n- **AAC Sentence Bar & Fullscreen Presentation**:\n  - Interactive top Sentence Bar with **Usu\305\204** (Delete last), **Wyczy\305\233\304\207** (Clear all), and **Powi\304\231ksz** (Fullscreen Modal view)."
